<title>USA: Grand Coulee dam 750 MW unit seen back up Wed.</title>
<headline>Grand Coulee dam 750 MW unit seen back up Wed.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 750 megawatt (MW) power turbine at the Grand Coulee hydroelectric dam in Washington should be back on line Wednesday afternoon after an unplanned outage Tuesday, a spokeswoman for the U.S. Bureau of Reclamation said.</p>
<p>Total generating capacity at the dam is near 6,000 MW, although a small portion of turbines are down for planned maintenance at any given time.</p>
<p>--D Beasley, Los Angeles bureau + 1 213 955 6761</p>
</text>
